    "limitations": [
      "Chromium browser assets require IDE disk transport. The extra USB run boots NT and passes kernel tests, but browser verification fails because the assets are unavailable.",
      "The experimental compatibility layer remains incomplete. Its getrandom fallback is noncryptographic and the Chromium compatibility library suppresses C++ exit callbacks.",
